        <h2 style="color: #003853; font-size: 1.8rem; font-family: var(--font-display, serif); margin-top: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">3. Practical Rules for Fly-In Bush Flights</h2>
        <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
          <li><strong>Soft Duffel Bags Only (Strict 15 kg Limit):</strong> Light aircraft (Cessna Caravan / Grand Caravan) luggage pods have strict dimensions. Hard-shell suitcases with wheels cannot be loaded. Pack flexible canvas or nylon duffel bags.</li>
          <li><strong>Malaria Prophylaxis:</strong> Mainland Tanzania carries higher malaria transmission than coastal Zanzibar. Consult your travel clinic about taking Malarone or Doxycycline, and wear long sleeves for dawn/dusk game drives.</li>
          <li><strong>Park Conservation Clearance:</strong> TANAPA and TAWA entry permits must be pre-registered with your passport details at least 48 hours before flight dispatch. All Spice &amp; Sail packages include all taxes and entrance permits upfront.</li>
        </ul>

